# Frame_ButtonFocused - the same button, lit up: brighter rim and face and a crisp 2 px gold glow ring in the
# 3 px glowMargin (hard alpha: a bright inner ring and a gold outer ring, like light spilling off the rim).
# 32x32, Sliced, border L7 B8 R7 T7, the same geometry as Frame_Button (visible button 26x26 at (3,3)).
size 32 32
key
  K #0a0c18  ink (outer line)
  W #fff4b8  glow, inner ring / rim highlight
  L #ffd65a  gold rim, shade sides
  O #e8a830  glow, outer ring
  X #5c360c  gold deep line
  a #4a5ea0  face, lit edge
  c #34447a  face
  e #1f2c56  face, shade edge / slab side
strokes
  line K 5 3 26 3 28 5 28 26 26 28 5 28 3 26 3 5 5 3
  rect X 5 5 26 26
  # the glow: two rings parallel to the outline, each with a clean 45 degree corner
  line W 5 2 26 2 29 5 29 26 26 29 5 29 2 26 2 5 5 2
  line O 5 1 26 1 30 5 30 26 26 30 5 30 1 26 1 5 5 1
seeds
  W 12 4 4 12
  L 12 27 27 12
  c 15 15
ops
  band c a 0 -1 1
  band c a -1 0 1
  band c e 1 0 1
  band c e 0 1 2
